Pinned Java source inventory: five public allocation strategies (`AllocateMessageQueueAveragely`, `AllocateMessageQueueAveragelyByCircle`, `AllocateMessageQueueByConfig`, `AllocateMessageQueueByMachineRoom`, `AllocateMessageQueueConsistentHash`). `RebalanceService` defaults are wait=20,000 ms and min=1,000 ms. The runtime already owns coalesced rebalance signals; Phase 11 must attach Push reconciliation and trigger it after successful startup/subscription changes.

Next action: add Java-generated allocation fixtures and implement/test P11-01/P11-03 strategy parity before lifecycle reconciliation.

